The purpose of this code of ethics is to:
(1) Encourage high ethical standards in official conduct by city officials and employees;
(2) Establish guidelines for ethical standards of conduct for all city officials and employees by setting forth those acts or actions that are incompatible with the interest of the city;
(3) Require disclosure by city officials and employees of private financial or other interest in matters affecting the city; and
(4) Serve as a basis for disciplining those who refuse to abide by its terms.
(Code 1991, § 1-9-1; Ord. No. 2017-04, § I, 4-4-2017)

